      {
        "title": "Omada Health (NASDAQ:OMDA) Releases Quarterly Earnings Results, Beats Expectations By $0.03 EPS - Stock Observer",
        "url": "https://www.thestockobserver.com/2026/05/09/omada-health-nasdaqomda-releases-quarterly-earnings-results-beats-expectations-by-0-03-eps.html",
        "snippet": "Omada Health (NASDAQ:OMDA) Releases Quarterly Earnings Results, Beats Expectations By $0.03 EPS - Stock Observer\n\n# Omada Health (NASDAQ:OMDA) Releases Quarterly Earnings Results, Beats Expectations By $0.03 EPS\n\nPosted by Brenda Bartman on May 9th, 2026\n\nShare on Twitter Share on Facebook Share on LinkedIn Share on Stocktwits\n\nOmada Health (NASDAQ:OMDA– Get Free Report) released its quarterly earnings data on Thursday. The company reported ($0.05) EPS for the quarter, beating the consensus estimate of ($0.08) by $0.03, FiscalAI reports. The firm had revenue of $78.05 million during the quarter. Omada Health had a negative return on equity of 1.85% and a negative net margin of 2.22%.\n\nHere are the key takeaways from Omada Health’s conference call:\n\nGet Omada Health alerts:\n\n- Q1 results beat on growth and profitability: $78 million revenue (+42% YoY), GAAP net loss narrowed to $3M, positive adjusted EBITDA ($1M), and management raised full‑year guidance to $322–330M revenue and $14–20M",
        "published_date": "2026-05-09T16:22:47.000Z"
      },
